{
  "scene_id": "act5_scene1_gathering",
  "start": "n1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_bg",
      "background": "assets/images/bg/front/evening1.png",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 1.0,
      "next": "n2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_music",
      "track": "assets/music/my_little_world.ogg",
      "volume": 0.4,
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 2.0,
      "next": "n3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The school gate looms ahead, bathed in the warm glow of evening. I've walked this path so many times now.",
      "next": "n4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But today feels different. Heavier. Like the air itself knows this is the last time.",
      "next": "n5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I remember the first day I found the club room. The sound of Hanami's humming through the door. The chaos. The arguments. The laughter.",
      "next": "n6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "All of it led here. To this one last evening.",
      "next": "n7"
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_bg",
      "background": "assets/images/bg/club3/evening1.png",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.8,
      "next": "n8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The club room is decorated. Someone hung paper stars from the ceiling and arranged the chairs in a half-circle. It looks beautiful. It looks like a farewell.",
      "next": "n10"
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n10"
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There is a chair set apart from the others — no one sat in it, no one moved it. Nobody had to say anything. We all knew.",
      "next": "n11"
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I can still hear her voice, clear as the day she said it. \"I wouldn't miss this for anything.\" She meant it then. I have to believe she would have meant it now.",
      "next": "n13"
    },
    {
      "id": "n12",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "Are you sure you're okay to play? You look—",
      "next": "n13"
    },
    {
      "id": "n13",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Some things are worth being a little tired for. She told me that once. I hold onto it.",
      "next": "n14"
    },
    {
      "id": "n14",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "slide_right",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n15"
    },
    {
      "id": "n15",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cassian walks in carrying a guitar case — a nicer one than usual. He brought his best guitar.",
      "next": "n16"
    },
    {
      "id": "n16",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "What? If it's the last time, might as well sound good.",
      "next": "n17"
    },
    {
      "id": "n17",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His hands are steady as he unlatches the case, but I notice the way his jaw tightens. He's nervous.",
      "next": "n18"
    },
    {
      "id": "n18",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "cheerful",
      "transition": "slide_left",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n19"
    },
    {
      "id": "n19",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "cheerful",
      "text": "Remember when I couldn't even play without shaking? God, that feels like a lifetime ago.",
      "next": "n20"
    },
    {
      "id": "n20",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "You've come a long way, Laura.",
      "next": "n21"
    },
    {
      "id": "n21",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "happy",
      "text": "We all have.",
      "next": "n22"
    },
    {
      "id": "n22",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The door opens one last time.",
      "next": "n23"
    },
    {
      "id": "n23",
      "type": "if",
      "condition": "tiffany_rot <= 0",
      "trueNode": "n24_tiffany_broken",
      "falseNode": "n24_tiffany_grateful"
    },
    {
      "id": "n24_tiffany_broken",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "broken_blood",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n25_tiffany_broken"
    },
    {
      "id": "n25_tiffany_broken",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "glitch",
      "intensity": 1.5,
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n26_tiffany_broken"
    },
    {
      "id": "n26_tiffany_broken",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "broken_blood",
      "text": "I'm here. I'm... I'm still here.",
      "text_effect": "glitch",
      "effect_intensity": 2.0,
      "next": "n27_tiffany_broken"
    },
    {
      "id": "n27_tiffany_broken",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Something is very wrong. Her eyes are unfocused, her hands trembling. She looks like she's held together by nothing but willpower.",
      "next": "n30_converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "n24_tiffany_grateful",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "crying",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n25_tiffany_grateful"
    },
    {
      "id": "n25_tiffany_grateful",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "crying",
      "text": "Thank you. All of you. For not giving up on me.",
      "next": "n26_tiffany_grateful"
    },
    {
      "id": "n26_tiffany_grateful",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "smirk",
      "text": "Don't get sappy on us now. Save it for after.",
      "next": "n27_tiffany_grateful"
    },
    {
      "id": "n27_tiffany_grateful",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tiffany laughs through her tears. It's the first real laugh I've heard from her in weeks.",
      "next": "n30_converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "n30_converge",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Everyone takes their places. One last rehearsal before the real thing.",
      "next": "n31"
    },
    {
      "id": "n31",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_sound",
      "sound": "assets/sounds/guitar_tuning.wav",
      "volume": 0.4,
      "next": "n32"
    },
    {
      "id": "n32",
      "type": "game",
      "song": "final_rehearsal_generated",
      "next": "n33"
    },
    {
      "id": "n33",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The last note hangs in the air like a held breath.",
      "next": "n34"
    },
    {
      "id": "n34",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Nobody speaks. We all know what tomorrow means. But right now, in this room, the music is still alive.",
      "next": "n35"
    },
    {
      "id": "n35",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_flag",
      "flag": "flags.final_day",
      "value": true,
      "next": "n36"
    },
